*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0805HT-1N8
* Inductance = 1.8nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-14.7GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0805HT-1N8 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.072pF Ind=1.8nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=6
+ R2=0.03
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00000604
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0805HT-1N8

